  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Now let's write the optimal solution carefully.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2700,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 81,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "First, store the number of rows in M and the number of columns in N.",
      "start_ms": 3360,
      "end_ms": 8880,
      "start_frame": 101,
      "end_frame": 266,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Create two booleans.",
      "start_ms": 9240,
      "end_ms": 10840,
      "start_frame": 277,
      "end_frame": 325,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "First, row 0 starts as false.",
      "start_ms": 11480,
      "end_ms": 13900,
      "start_frame": 344,
      "end_frame": 417,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "First call 0 starts as false.",
      "start_ms": 14600,
      "end_ms": 16480,
      "start_frame": 438,
      "end_frame": 494,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Before we use the boundary as marker memory, save its original state.",
      "start_ms": 17260,
      "end_ms": 22120,
      "start_frame": 518,
      "end_frame": 664,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Scan the first row.",
      "start_ms": 22420,
      "end_ms": 23500,
      "start_frame": 673,
      "end_frame": 705,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "If any cell is 0, set first row 0 to true.",
      "start_ms": 24000,
      "end_ms": 28160,
      "start_frame": 720,
      "end_frame": 845,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Then scan the first column.",
      "start_ms": 28160,
      "end_ms": 30060,
      "start_frame": 845,
      "end_frame": 902,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "If any cell is 0, set first call 0 to true.",
      "start_ms": 30560,
      "end_ms": 34100,
      "start_frame": 917,
      "end_frame": 1023,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the boundary history is protected.",
      "start_ms": 34660,
      "end_ms": 36620,
      "start_frame": 1040,
      "end_frame": 1099,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Next scan only the interior.",
      "start_ms": 37260,
      "end_ms": 39100,
      "start_frame": 1118,
      "end_frame": 1173,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Start rows from 1 and columns from 1.",
      "start_ms": 39780,
      "end_ms": 42860,
      "start_frame": 1193,
      "end_frame": 1286,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever matrix base is 0, write 0 into matrix 0.",
      "start_ms": 43360,
      "end_ms": 48380,
      "start_frame": 1301,
      "end_frame": 1451,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "That marks the row.",
      "start_ms": 49060,
      "end_ms": 50080,
      "start_frame": 1472,
      "end_frame": 1502,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Then write 0 into matrix 0.",
      "start_ms": 50780,
      "end_ms": 52840,
      "start_frame": 1523,
      "end_frame": 1585,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "See, that marks the column.",
      "start_ms": 53180,
      "end_ms": 54880,
      "start_frame": 1595,
      "end_frame": 1646,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "After this pass, the first row and first column are our marker arrays.",
      "start_ms": 54880,
      "end_ms": 60180,
      "start_frame": 1646,
      "end_frame": 1805,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Now apply the markers.",
      "start_ms": 60540,
      "end_ms": 61660,
      "start_frame": 1816,
      "end_frame": 1850,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, scan only the interior.",
      "start_ms": 62100,
      "end_ms": 64080,
      "start_frame": 1863,
      "end_frame": 1922,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "For each cell, if matrix 0 is 0 or matrix 0 is 0, set matrix C to 0.",
      "start_ms": 64540,
      "end_ms": 73340,
      "start_frame": 1936,
      "end_frame": 2200,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "At this point, the interior is final.",
      "start_ms": 73980,
      "end_ms": 76380,
      "start_frame": 2219,
      "end_frame": 2291,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Only the boundary remains.",
      "start_ms": 76980,
      "end_ms": 78340,
      "start_frame": 2309,
      "end_frame": 2350,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "If first row 0 is true, 0 every cell in row 0.",
      "start_ms": 78920,
      "end_ms": 83640,
      "start_frame": 2368,
      "end_frame": 2509,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "And if first call 0 is true, 0 every cell in column 0.",
      "start_ms": 83640,
      "end_ms": 88240,
      "start_frame": 2509,
      "end_frame": 2647,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the complete optimal solution.",
      "start_ms": 88860,
      "end_ms": 91240,
      "start_frame": 2666,
      "end_frame": 2737,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice the order.",
      "start_ms": 92060,
      "end_ms": 92860,
      "start_frame": 2762,
      "end_frame": 2786,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Save boundary history.",
      "start_ms": 93320,
      "end_ms": 94940,
      "start_frame": 2800,
